			"notes": "## [1.0.11] - 2026-08-11\n\n### Added\n- **ComboHUD**: Displays the current hit streak against enemies.\n- **CPSHUD**: Shows real-time clicks per second for both mouse buttons.\n- **DamageHUD**: Indicates exact damage dealt per successful hit.\n- **InGameTimeHUD**: Tracks elapsed time since the match started.\n- **ReachHUD**: Shows the block distance between the player and the target.\n- **TnTHUD**: Adds a countdown timer for primed TNT entities.\n\n### Changed\n- **SpeedHUD**: Added a configurable option to toggle speed unit display between **km/h** and **m/s**."
		},
